          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Elon Musk and Sam Altman head to trial over OpenAI's for-profit future and IPO plans",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "Elon Musk and OpenAI CEO Sam Altman are heading to trial in Northern California in a case that could determine whether OpenAI is legally permitted to operate as a for-profit company. The court could also order Altman's removal as CEO, casting a shadow over OpenAI's anticipated IPO. The case marks the culmination of a years-long legal feud between the two over the company's founding mission as a nonprofit dedicated to the public good.",
            "url": "https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/04/27/1136466/elon-musk-and-sam-altman-are-going-to-court-over-openais-future/",
